Śūrpaṇakhā leads fourteen Rākṣasas to Rāma hut --- Rāma bids Lakṣmaṇa guard Sītā while he kills --- Rāma declares identity mission and warns Rākṣasas retreat --- Rākṣasas mock lone Rāma and threaten death --- Rākṣasas rush hurling pikes at Rāma --- Rāma shatters fourteen pikes with arrows --- Rāma kills fourteen Rākṣasas with sunlike shafts --- Śūrpaṇakhā wails and reports slaughter to Khara